{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2159","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Super-Short-Polynomial-San"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"7 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1024 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"This problem might be well-known in some countries, but how do other countries learn about such problems if nobody poses them?"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"— "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://qoj.ac/problem/3091"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"XXI Open Cup, Grand Prix of Tokyo"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given three integers $$$a,b,c$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let $$$F(n)$$$ be the polynomial of degree $$$2n$$$ defined as follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$$$$F(n)=\\left ({a x^2+b x+c}\\right) ^n$$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are asked to solve $$$q$$$ queries of the following kind."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$n\\;k$$$: Please find the value of the sum $$$\\displaystyle \\sum_{i=0}^{k}{\\left [ {x^i} \\right] F(n)}$$$ modulo $$$10^9+7$$$$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"However, it might be too easy for you if this problem ends here. So here is a twist$$$^{\\text{†}}$$$: You are asked to solve the queries "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"online"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{∗}}$$$Here, $$$[x^a]F(n)$$$ denotes the coefficient of $$$x^a$$$ of the polynomial $$$F(n)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^{\\text{†}}$$$I hope it isn't too hard for you after the twist. Even a toddler knows one way to solve it. You just have to optimize that method by a factor of $$$8\\,000\\,000$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains three integers $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$ ($$$1 \\le a,b,c \\le 10^9+6$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains the number of queries $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 3 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the $$$q$$$ following lines contains two integers $$$n_i'$$$ and $$$k_i'$$$ denoting the query in encrypted format."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You must decrypt the queries as follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Let the answer to the $$$i$$$-th query modulo $$$10^9+7$$$ be $$$ans_i$$$. Here, $$$ans_0$$$ is defined to be $$$0$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Then, the values of $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ for the $$$i$$$-th query are $$$n_i = n_i' \\oplus ans_{i-1}$$$ and $$$k_i = k_i' \\oplus ans_{i-1}$$$ ($$$0 \\le n_i \\le 3\\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$0 \\le k_i \\le 2n_i$$$). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Do note that "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"both"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" the sum of $$$n_i$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"and"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" the sum of $$$k_i$$$ over all queries "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"are not bounded"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each query, print the answer modulo $$$10^9+7$$$ on a new line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 2 1\n11\n0 0\n0 1\n0 0\n2 1\n4 6\n3 0\n7 7\n13 12\n25 31\n31379 9237\n396176013 396306657\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n1\n3\n6\n1\n5\n15\n27\n36\n396240845\n819003547\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The decrypted example input is as follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 2 1\n11\n0 0\n1 0\n1 1\n1 2\n2 0\n2 1\n2 2\n2 3\n2 4\n31415 9265\n200000 69420"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here, the polynomial $$$F(n)$$$ corresponds to "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://oeis.org/A084608"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A084608"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" from OEIS. Don't worry about the link; there's nothing so useful there. Trust me."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"2159E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2159/problem/E"}